const string TT_EOD    = "Paste one line per ticker as TICKER: Name=price, Name=price, ... The line matching the chart is used (MNQ uses NQ, MES uses ES, MGC uses GC, SIL uses SI, MCL uses CL). Example:\nNQ: GEX10=27750, Call Resistance=27600, GEX6=27500, 1D Max=27372.57, Put Support 0DTE=27010, Gamma Wall 0DTE=27000, HVL=26850, GEX1=26500, 1D Min=26317.43, Put Support=26000\nES: Call Resistance=7550, GEX8=7450, HVL=7325, GEX1=7200, Put Support=7000\n'Name, price' pairs also work. Names not in the grading chart are drawn but never used as confluence."
